    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d185-a1">

                <pb facs="0262" n="996" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg996"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 357.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Resolved by the Senate</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">the
                        House of Representatives concurring</hi>), That the Congress of the United
                    States has learned with high gratification of the special honors paid to the
                    memory of the deceased by the Government of Mexico upon the occasion of the
                    death of the Hon. Isaac P. Gray, late minister of the United States, near the
                    Republic of Mexico.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Resolved</hi>, That in token of the appreciation of the
                    same, the Secretary of State be requested to forward to the Mexican Government
                    an enrolled copy of this resolution.</p>
                <p>Passed the Senate February 21, 1895.</p>
                <p>Passed the House of Representatives February 22, 1895.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
